WEBVTT

00:14.440 --> 00:17.750
Nishimura-san always looks so gloomy.

00:17.750 --> 00:20.530
Totally. Major Grim Reaper vibes.

00:20.530 --> 00:21.400
Huh?

00:24.680 --> 00:25.750
Good morning!

00:25.290 --> 00:26.390
Good morning!

00:25.620 --> 00:26.940
Aw, crap!

00:26.940 --> 00:29.350
I didn't wanna see 
the Grim Reaper first thing!

00:30.250 --> 00:35.300
<b>G O O D   M O R N I N G</b>

00:30.560 --> 00:32.170
Better get away from her!

00:32.170 --> 00:34.020
Don't want the Grim Reaper's curse!

00:34.020 --> 00:35.300
Barrier! Barrier!

00:41.180 --> 00:44.440
<b>Push to cross</b>

00:44.810 --> 00:47.240
Phew! Man, that was close!

00:47.240 --> 00:48.930
So scary!

00:50.110 --> 00:51.670
<i>The Grim Reaper?!</i>

01:09.060 --> 01:11.960
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

01:09.690 --> 01:11.960
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

02:37.880 --> 02:42.010
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

02:43.180 --> 02:48.660
<i>Episode 1 "The Grim Reaper and the Transfer Student"</i>

02:51.440 --> 02:53.670
<b>Nishiyama{right label}</b>

02:51.440 --> 02:54.210
<b>Nishimura{center label}</b>

02:53.680 --> 02:54.730
Good morning!

02:56.080 --> 02:57.780
Good morning, Adachi-san!

02:57.780 --> 02:59.550
Hey! Good morning.

03:00.280 --> 03:02.030
Did you catch that TV drama last night?

03:05.010 --> 03:08.320
That's the book the Grim Reaper
 was reading earlier!

03:08.320 --> 03:09.780
What? Nishimura was?

03:10.080 --> 03:12.950
Don't touch it! You'll catch her curse!

03:13.900 --> 03:17.060
Nishimura-san really does seem
 like a Grim Reaper, doesn't she?

03:17.060 --> 03:18.450
See? Just look at her.

03:19.590 --> 03:23.100
Is she casting her curse 
on those goldfish, you think?

03:23.100 --> 03:25.700
Oh, no! How terrifying!

03:25.700 --> 03:29.480
Don't they kinda look like piranhas now?

03:31.890 --> 03:36.560
<i>I'm new to this class,
 so I don't know the story,</i>

03:36.560 --> 03:38.770
<i>but Nishimura-san the Grim Reaper...</i>

03:38.770 --> 03:41.560
<i>Why does everyone call her that?</i>

03:42.080 --> 03:43.560
Dang it!

03:43.560 --> 03:44.740
That's...

03:44.740 --> 03:49.410
That's such an awesome nickname!

04:04.330 --> 04:06.800
Nishimura-san!

04:07.320 --> 04:08.810
Nishimura-san!

04:09.090 --> 04:11.970
Um... Takada-kun?

04:12.480 --> 04:15.030
Hey, I wanna ask you something.

04:15.030 --> 04:17.980
Huh? Okay... What is it?

04:18.350 --> 04:22.730
Nishimura-san, why does everyone 
call you... the Grim Reaper?

04:23.810 --> 04:25.570
I can't say for sure.

04:28.990 --> 04:33.040
It's probably because of my glaring eyes.

04:33.040 --> 04:36.060
I must remind them of a dead fish.

04:36.410 --> 04:38.040
I see.

04:38.040 --> 04:40.390
So you really are special, then.

04:40.390 --> 04:41.070
Hmm?

04:41.610 --> 04:44.670
I've been thinking about it 
ever since I got to school.

04:44.670 --> 04:46.560
It's just so cool!

04:47.000 --> 04:48.280
Um...

04:48.280 --> 04:52.140
Takada-kun, you should keep 
your distance just like everyone else.

04:52.140 --> 04:54.230
If not, they say you'll catch my curse.

04:54.230 --> 04:55.270
I will?!

04:55.270 --> 04:56.550
Tell me more! Tell me more!

04:56.550 --> 04:58.730
That's so radical!

04:58.730 --> 05:04.310
It's a deadly curse that spreads
 when you get near me or touch me.

05:04.540 --> 05:05.980
A deadly curse?!

05:05.980 --> 05:09.370
We're only in grade school, 
but you've got such fearsome power?!

05:09.790 --> 05:13.830
Man, that's incredible! I'm so jealous!

05:13.240 --> 05:14.870
Wait... What?

05:15.450 --> 05:17.770
I-It's nothing to be jealous of.

05:17.770 --> 05:19.240
Everyone avoids me...

05:19.240 --> 05:21.400
I-It's <i>that</i> powerful?!

05:21.400 --> 05:24.060
Must be nice! I wish that were me!

05:24.490 --> 05:25.920
B-But why?

05:26.370 --> 05:28.920
I mean, being a Grim Reaper sounds awesome!

05:28.920 --> 05:31.990
Everyone shuns you, even though
 you've done nothing wrong.

05:31.990 --> 05:34.720
That's just proof of your dreadful powers!

05:35.030 --> 05:36.180
My powers?

05:36.570 --> 05:39.780
Nishimura-san, would you touch me?

05:39.780 --> 05:41.830
Huh? Why?

05:41.830 --> 05:44.920
Everyone will tease you about 
being cursed and stuff.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.190
I want them to.

05:46.190 --> 05:47.710
You do?!

05:47.710 --> 05:51.140
They'll say things like
 "you're friends with the Grim Reaper!"

05:51.140 --> 05:52.670
Yup! Fine by me!

05:52.670 --> 05:57.820
I-If they think you're being nice to me,
 they might say even harsher things.

05:57.820 --> 05:59.540
I <i>want</i> them to talk!

06:00.320 --> 06:04.700
So I'd love to get closer 
to you, Nishimura-san!

06:12.620 --> 06:17.590
<i>I have no clue how things 
even ended up this way.</i>

06:18.400 --> 06:23.040
<i>All I can say is that Takada-kun, 
the clueless transfer student,</i>

06:23.040 --> 06:25.390
<i>was coming on rather strong.</i>

06:26.210 --> 06:29.310
Hey, let's go play some soccer!

06:29.310 --> 06:30.110
Yeah!

06:30.110 --> 06:31.630
Let's do it!

06:31.630 --> 06:33.240
Nishimura-san!

06:33.670 --> 06:35.270
Nishimura-san!

06:36.310 --> 06:38.940
Wanna walk home together today?

06:38.940 --> 06:39.900
Huh?

06:39.900 --> 06:43.090
I'll fire off more of my killer shots again!

06:48.630 --> 06:50.200
What's this?

06:50.200 --> 06:53.070
The new kid is talking to the Grim Reaper!

06:53.070 --> 06:56.130
Yikes! He's gonna get cursed!

07:02.510 --> 07:05.470
Sorry, I'll go home by myself.

07:05.470 --> 07:06.180
What?!

07:06.470 --> 07:10.940
Then... Then who am I 
supposed to walk home with?

07:12.800 --> 07:15.960
Well, I don't know about that,
 but nevertheless...

07:16.710 --> 07:18.240
Didn't I warn you?

07:18.240 --> 07:21.850
If you're nice to me, 
they'll say you're cursed

07:21.850 --> 07:24.630
or that you're pals with the Grim Reaper.

07:24.630 --> 07:26.760
What?! That rules!

07:26.760 --> 07:28.030
Totally cool by me!

07:28.030 --> 07:30.980
I wanna hear them say
 I'm the Grim Reaper's pal!

07:32.720 --> 07:35.690
You're an odd duck, Takada-kun.

07:36.330 --> 07:37.680
You think so?

07:36.840 --> 07:38.800
Hey, new kid!

07:41.570 --> 07:43.020
Kitagawa-kun?

07:43.020 --> 07:45.420
You should walk home with us

07:45.420 --> 07:47.970
instead of Reaper girl over there.

07:48.220 --> 07:51.200
I'll even let you join the Scorpion Gang!

07:51.200 --> 07:52.780
What? Really?

07:53.260 --> 07:55.070
Isn't that great, Nishimura-san?

07:55.070 --> 07:57.260
Now the Grim Reaper has even more pals!

07:57.260 --> 07:57.870
Huh?

07:59.180 --> 08:01.140
No, I meant you, Takada!

08:01.140 --> 08:02.820
I was only inviting you!

08:02.820 --> 08:05.280
Oh, is that how it is?

08:08.570 --> 08:11.010
Quit yankin' my chain, new kid!

08:11.010 --> 08:13.880
Who'd wanna walk home with Reaper girl?

08:14.180 --> 08:18.260
I wanna walk home with Nishimura-san.

08:18.260 --> 08:20.180
U-Um...

08:20.690 --> 08:25.970
I also think you should stay 
away from me, Takada-kun.

08:25.970 --> 08:28.700
Huh? Not you, too, Nishimura-san!

08:28.700 --> 08:31.310
I'll be fine on my own.

08:31.310 --> 08:32.540
I'm used to it.

08:43.220 --> 08:44.420
See?! Look!

08:44.420 --> 08:46.870
She said she's fine by herself!

08:46.870 --> 08:49.180
Come with us, new kid!

08:50.000 --> 08:54.840
But, Kitagawa-kun, 
you're just an ordinary human.

08:54.840 --> 08:57.920
And what's wrong with that, huh?!

08:57.920 --> 09:01.700
If you're gonna play that game,
Nishimura's an ordinary human, too!

09:01.700 --> 09:02.520
Huh?

09:02.880 --> 09:06.200
Nishimura-san's the Grim Reaper, isn't she?

09:08.020 --> 09:11.210
That's what you've been saying all this time.

09:17.120 --> 09:18.470
What's wrong?

09:25.940 --> 09:28.040
I see it, too!

09:28.040 --> 09:31.220
Nishimura-san's just so stoic and cool!

09:31.220 --> 09:35.650
That's why I want to get to know her better!

09:39.990 --> 09:42.480
What's up, Nishimura-san?

09:43.740 --> 09:47.910
What if I'm not the Grim Reaper after all?

09:48.870 --> 09:52.560
Maybe my glare is just kind of intimidating...

09:53.060 --> 09:54.830
What? You think so?

09:55.260 --> 09:58.190
But I love your sharp eyes!

09:58.190 --> 09:59.710
They're mega-cool!

10:02.950 --> 10:06.920
I think they're really 
wonderful, Nishimura-san.

10:08.320 --> 10:12.020
Y-Yeah... Thanks.

10:15.650 --> 10:16.400
Oh.

10:17.850 --> 10:20.880
Sorry, Kitagawa-kun. 
I forgot you were there.

10:21.400 --> 10:23.930
You've really got some nerve, you know that?!

10:24.260 --> 10:26.850
Give it up already, Kitagawa.

10:26.850 --> 10:30.060
Let's just leave this weirdo alone.

10:31.750 --> 10:34.180
Darn it! Don't think you've
 gotten the better of me!

10:34.770 --> 10:39.160
Huh? I didn't realize we were 
fighting about something.

10:40.470 --> 10:43.830
Wait, why are you laughing, Nishimura-san?

10:44.430 --> 10:46.890
W-Well, I mean...

10:50.330 --> 10:52.340
Bye, Kitagawa-kun!

10:52.340 --> 10:53.600
See you tomorrow!

10:53.600 --> 10:57.520
I've had it with you! 
How happy-go-lucky can you get?!

11:00.030 --> 11:01.940
Man, this rules!

11:01.940 --> 11:04.850
You're the coolest, Nishimura-san.

11:04.850 --> 11:06.900
Let's walk home tomorrow, too, okay?

11:06.900 --> 11:08.250
It's a promise!

11:08.800 --> 11:10.780
I... I don't mind.

11:11.630 --> 11:14.970
B-But why do we have to hold hands?

11:14.970 --> 11:19.810
Because if I touch you, I can be 
bestowed with your powerful curse!

11:20.210 --> 11:22.520
But I'll let go if you don't like it.

11:23.790 --> 11:26.340
I mean... I'm okay with it...

11:26.780 --> 11:31.840
I can't wait to become a sweet 
Grim Reaper like you, Nishimura-san!

11:31.840 --> 11:33.180
Whoo!

11:34.590 --> 11:39.010
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

11:45.470 --> 11:49.110
How are things at school, Akane?

11:49.110 --> 11:49.850
Huh?

11:50.320 --> 11:53.830
Well, you know, like your classes.

11:53.830 --> 11:56.580
Are you having a hard time with anything?

11:57.200 --> 11:59.840
Not really. I'm fine.

12:01.470 --> 12:04.640
<i>I've been lying when I'm at home...</i>

12:05.290 --> 12:08.060
<i>for as long as I can remember.</i>

12:11.840 --> 12:13.750
Whoa, it's the Grim Reaper!

12:13.750 --> 12:14.830
We're in danger!

12:14.830 --> 12:16.290
Barrier! Barrier!

12:17.600 --> 12:19.620
Th-That's awesome!

12:22.860 --> 12:26.010
Good morning, Nishimura-san!

12:26.010 --> 12:27.930
G-Good morning.

12:27.930 --> 12:29.640
You're full of energy again today.

12:29.640 --> 12:31.020
You think so?

12:31.670 --> 12:33.820
Anyway, Nishimura-san...

12:33.820 --> 12:37.540
There's something I've been 
wondering ever since I got here.

12:39.840 --> 12:44.520
Can everyone in our class use barriers?

12:44.520 --> 12:45.640
Barriers?

12:46.050 --> 12:49.740
They're always shouting, "Barrier! Barrier!"

12:50.040 --> 12:50.860
Oh.

12:51.310 --> 12:55.200
Uh, that's... a game they like to play.

12:55.200 --> 12:56.770
Isn't it ridiculous?

12:56.770 --> 13:00.100
They say you can avoid my curse
 if you put up a barrier.

13:00.100 --> 13:01.970
Huh? Hold it right there!

13:02.760 --> 13:05.910
They're treating barriers
 like a game? That's wild!

13:05.910 --> 13:06.610
Huh?

13:06.610 --> 13:10.920
I mean, barriers are super advanced!
At least, I think they are.

13:10.920 --> 13:14.520
I've tried to use one so many times...

13:15.040 --> 13:16.430
But I couldn't.

13:16.430 --> 13:17.980
You've tried before?

13:18.530 --> 13:21.600
How does everyone manage to do it?

13:21.600 --> 13:22.950
No, c'mon now...

13:23.270 --> 13:28.730
There wasn't anyone who could
 put up barriers at my old school.

13:31.190 --> 13:32.910
I see.

13:32.910 --> 13:36.090
It sounds like you all got along.

13:36.090 --> 13:39.920
Yep! There were only thirty
 of us in the whole school.

13:39.920 --> 13:41.950
And I was friends with most everyone!

13:42.350 --> 13:44.060
<i>Friends...</i>

13:44.060 --> 13:47.020
I really do wanna use barriers, though!

13:47.020 --> 13:48.390
They're so awesome!

13:49.300 --> 13:52.780
Am I supposed to imagine 
a wall in front of me?

13:52.780 --> 13:54.010
Use my aura?

13:54.010 --> 13:56.860
I hope you learn how to use barriers.

13:56.860 --> 14:01.010
That way, we can talk 
and you won't get teased.

13:57.790 --> 13:58.920
Like this?!

14:01.490 --> 14:03.230
Huh? Why's that?

14:03.800 --> 14:08.100
Because barriers ward off
 the Grim Reaper's curse.

14:08.100 --> 14:11.980
But why would I put up a barrier with you?

14:11.980 --> 14:12.580
Huh?

14:12.970 --> 14:15.860
They're for when enemies attack.

14:16.530 --> 14:20.260
I'd never need to use one 
against you, Nishimura-san.

14:24.280 --> 14:25.870
'Cause we're friends.

14:29.950 --> 14:32.180
F-Friends?

14:32.940 --> 14:34.060
Akane.

14:35.910 --> 14:38.790
How are things at school?

14:39.420 --> 14:41.200
Like usual.

14:41.580 --> 14:43.020
I see.

14:46.120 --> 14:49.190
Have you made any good friends?

14:51.300 --> 14:54.190
<i>I've been lying when I'm at home...</i>

14:55.310 --> 14:58.040
<i>for as long as I can remember.</i>

14:58.770 --> 14:59.670
Akane?

15:01.380 --> 15:02.740
Don't worry.

15:02.740 --> 15:04.620
I've got friends.

15:08.110 --> 15:09.550
<i>I see...</i>

15:09.550 --> 15:11.700
<i>It's not a lie anymore.</i>

15:12.130 --> 15:13.650
<i>It's really true now.</i>

15:14.540 --> 15:16.800
What's the matter, Nishimura-san?

15:17.080 --> 15:19.660
D-D-Don't misunderstand, Takada-kun!

15:19.660 --> 15:22.630
Th-This is, um...
I was s-so happy, I suddenly...

15:22.630 --> 15:25.020
What're you talking about, Nishimura-san?

15:25.020 --> 15:25.770
Huh?

15:26.400 --> 15:30.720
I'm even way, <i>way</i> happier than you are!

15:30.720 --> 15:33.400
'Cause I get to be friends with you!

15:34.010 --> 15:36.280
<i>Oh, my gosh...</i>

15:36.280 --> 15:38.480
<i>Takada-kun is so...</i>

15:47.180 --> 15:49.460
Wow, 7.3 seconds!

15:49.460 --> 15:52.840
Amazing! You're faster than me,
 the fastest kid in class!

15:53.480 --> 15:55.290
Thanks, Hino-kun!

15:55.640 --> 15:58.130
<i>Takada-kun is incredible.</i>

15:58.130 --> 15:59.360
Huh...

16:02.800 --> 16:04.400
That's nuts!

16:04.400 --> 16:05.780
I wanna try, too!

16:05.780 --> 16:06.570
Yeah!

16:09.700 --> 16:10.370
Wh...

16:11.440 --> 16:12.960
Wh-What's the big deal?!

16:12.960 --> 16:16.010
Ah, s-sorry, Kasahara-san.

16:16.010 --> 16:18.550
Hmph! Are you trying to curse me?

16:18.550 --> 16:19.300
Um...

16:22.780 --> 16:24.330
Hey!

16:24.670 --> 16:27.390
We get to play dodgeball 
until the end of class!

16:27.390 --> 16:29.340
Heck yeah!

16:29.340 --> 16:30.500
Take that!

16:30.810 --> 16:32.980
What a wimpy throw!

16:32.980 --> 16:35.480
Okay! Eat this, Reaper girl!

16:37.270 --> 16:39.690
I've got you, Nishimura-san!

16:39.690 --> 16:42.800
This may come as a surprise, 
but I'm good at dodgeball!

16:42.800 --> 16:43.440
Oh!

16:43.440 --> 16:43.910
Huh?

16:43.910 --> 16:44.380
Ah!

16:45.730 --> 16:47.510
Takada-kun!

16:50.280 --> 16:54.400
Takada-kun ended up spending the 
rest of the day in the nurse's office.

16:54.400 --> 16:56.710
Think it was the Grim Reaper's curse?

16:56.710 --> 16:58.020
You read my mind!

16:58.020 --> 17:01.780
Takada-kun's been hanging out
with Nishimura-san a lot.

17:01.780 --> 17:04.710
<i>I hope Takada-kun is okay...</i>

17:04.710 --> 17:05.480
Oh...

17:10.360 --> 17:14.630
<b>Stretcher</b>

17:10.860 --> 17:14.640
<i>By no means am I here
 out of personal concern for him.</i>

17:14.640 --> 17:16.730
<i>I simply...</i>

17:18.200 --> 17:20.570
<i>came to give him this handout.</i>

17:21.140 --> 17:22.680
What're you up to?

17:23.020 --> 17:24.220
Hino-kun?

17:24.220 --> 17:25.940
I-It's nothing...

17:25.940 --> 17:27.270
Shucks.

17:27.670 --> 17:28.610
Er...

17:29.880 --> 17:31.110
Takada!

17:31.110 --> 17:33.970
I brought your serving of custard from lunch!

17:33.970 --> 17:35.280
Hino-kun!

17:35.280 --> 17:37.330
Hey, you look right as rain!

17:37.330 --> 17:39.440
He beat me to it.

17:39.450 --> 17:40.830
w/ soy whipped cream{thin black text}

17:39.450 --> 17:40.830
<b>Custard{bold black text}</b>

17:41.070 --> 17:43.370
Thanks for going out of your way, Hino-kun!

17:44.440 --> 17:45.310
No prob!

17:45.310 --> 17:46.970
We're best buds, aren't we?

17:46.970 --> 17:50.900
<i>Takada-kun and Hino-kun 
are already best friends!</i>

17:50.900 --> 17:52.570
Are you hurt anywhere?

17:52.570 --> 17:54.870
I can give you a piggyback 
ride home if you want!

17:55.600 --> 17:57.960
I'm fine now! Check it out!

17:57.960 --> 17:59.830
Whoa, amazing!

17:59.830 --> 18:01.490
Yay!

18:00.550 --> 18:01.990
C'mon, c'mon!

18:01.990 --> 18:04.100
<i>Takada-kun looks like he's having fun.</i>

18:04.100 --> 18:07.340
<i>It'd be hard to butt in on them like this...</i>

18:07.340 --> 18:09.090
Whoa, it's the Grim Reaper!

18:09.090 --> 18:11.710
Oh, no! What's she doing here?

18:11.710 --> 18:13.060
Let's get out of here!

18:14.170 --> 18:16.200
<i>I'll just go home.</i>

18:16.680 --> 18:17.440
<i>Oh...</i>

18:17.970 --> 18:19.310
<i>The handout.</i>

18:20.150 --> 18:24.480
<i>But if I go in there, 
it'll just start more rumors.</i>

18:25.080 --> 18:26.260
See you!

18:26.260 --> 18:27.690
Bye-bye!

18:26.960 --> 18:28.710
I'm off!

18:29.100 --> 18:33.420
<i>Huh... I didn't talk much to anyone today.</i>

18:35.010 --> 18:37.660
<i>It feels kind of weird.</i>

18:38.860 --> 18:42.010
<i>Yet it was normal up until just recently.</i>

18:47.430 --> 18:50.540
<i>This is how I used to be...</i>

18:59.880 --> 19:03.410
Wh-Why didn't you come visit me,
 Nishimura-san?!

19:03.740 --> 19:06.740
I was waiting this whole time!

19:05.620 --> 19:06.740
What?!

19:06.740 --> 19:11.810
Hino-kun told me as he was leaving 
that you were waiting out in the hall!

19:11.810 --> 19:13.750
I was so excited!

19:13.750 --> 19:14.620
<i>H...</i>

19:14.620 --> 19:16.090
<i>Hino-kun!</i>

19:16.620 --> 19:18.420
D-Don't get the wrong idea.

19:18.420 --> 19:21.900
I'm just here to give you this handout.

19:22.180 --> 19:24.740
Huh? That's all?

19:25.870 --> 19:27.140
I...

19:27.140 --> 19:30.800
wanted to brag about my sweet third eye!

19:30.800 --> 19:33.290
That's just where you got hit, isn't it?

19:33.900 --> 19:36.180
Takada-kun, are you okay?

19:36.180 --> 19:38.520
It really wasn't a big deal!

19:38.520 --> 19:41.670
I took a nap 'cause I was sleepy, 
and class was over before I knew it.

19:43.600 --> 19:46.270
Oh, you'll never believe the nurse's office!

19:46.270 --> 19:47.080
Huh?

19:47.080 --> 19:49.280
They've got a water cooler in there!

19:49.280 --> 19:52.000
Hey, let's get a drink and chat!

19:52.560 --> 19:53.820
But...

19:53.820 --> 19:57.090
if you're alone with me,
people will make up rumors about us.

19:57.090 --> 19:58.490
What kind of rumors?

19:59.320 --> 20:01.910
W-W... Well...

20:02.790 --> 20:06.920
L-Like "He's really been drawn in
 by the Grim Reaper's curse!"

20:06.920 --> 20:10.560
B-Bad stuff like that.

20:10.560 --> 20:11.580
Oh.

20:12.320 --> 20:14.390
I don't mind if they start rumors about us.

20:15.180 --> 20:16.700
What about you?

20:17.900 --> 20:21.230
I... I... I...

20:22.170 --> 20:25.650
I don't... mind either...

20:27.230 --> 20:30.520
Well? Isn't this water cooler water tasty?

20:30.520 --> 20:32.900
It's nothing like tap water!

20:32.900 --> 20:33.600
Yeah.

20:36.150 --> 20:38.190
It really is different.

20:40.550 --> 20:43.620
I'm so glad you came to see me.

20:43.620 --> 20:46.330
We didn't get to talk much today.

20:46.330 --> 20:47.120
Huh?

20:47.120 --> 20:51.130
I'm glad we got to make up
 for it before going home.

20:51.130 --> 20:54.480
Talking with you is always 
so much fun, Nishimura-san!

20:54.880 --> 20:57.180
It's really the best!

20:57.820 --> 21:02.590
I also enjoy talking with you...

21:03.040 --> 21:04.940
R-Really?!

21:05.190 --> 21:06.990
Woo-hoo!

21:08.100 --> 21:10.680
<i>Being called the Grim Reaper...</i>

21:10.680 --> 21:13.250
<i>Weird rumors spreading about me...</i>

21:13.600 --> 21:16.370
<i>Right now, I don't care about any of that.</i>

22:48.010 --> 22:53.140
<b><u>Mr. & Mrs. Grim Reaper</u>
Takada & Nishimura</b>

22:53.130 --> 22:55.380
What is this?

22:55.380 --> 22:57.670
Oh, I'm sorry about that...

22:57.670 --> 23:01.760
I'm sure they were trying to tease me,

23:01.760 --> 23:04.890
but you got dragged into
 this too because of me...

23:04.890 --> 23:06.910
Do you think they're really going out?

23:06.910 --> 23:08.360
Woo-hoo!

23:08.700 --> 23:10.490
Woo-hoo! Woo-hoo!

23:10.490 --> 23:12.560
Whoo! This rules!

23:12.560 --> 23:15.190
Wh-Why are you so happy?

23:15.190 --> 23:15.740
What?

23:16.060 --> 23:18.850
Seriously?! You don't think 
that's just the coolest?!

23:18.620 --> 23:20.250
<b>Mr. & Mrs.
 Grim Reaper</b>

23:18.850 --> 23:20.240
We're the Grim Reapers!

23:20.840 --> 23:25.300
This means everyone's 
finally accepted me as one!

23:26.840 --> 23:30.240
Yeah, I don't think that's
 what's going on here...

23:30.240 --> 23:30.970
Huh?

23:30.970 --> 23:34.970
<b>Grim Reaper</b>

23:31.370 --> 23:33.710
It's not?!

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next time...{black text top right}</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>Lunch Duty and Ghost Photographs and Love Letters</b>
